# Git SSH allowed signers file
# Copy to allowed_signers and fill in your real emails and public key.
# Format: <email> <key-type> <public-key>
#
# You can add multiple lines for multiple emails (e.g. personal + work).

your.email@example.com ssh-ed25519 AAAA...your-public-key...
your.work@company.com ssh-ed25519 AAAA...your-public-key...
